          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Sidebar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher la barre latérale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Tabs As": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les onglets en"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show as Cards": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher en cartes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show as List": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher en liste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sidebar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barre latérale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sideways to go from tab to tab, past the last for a new one. Up to see every tab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le côté pour passer d'un onglet à l'autre, au-delà du dernier pour en ouvrir un. Vers le haut pour voir tous les onglets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to iCloud in the iPhone's Settings to sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connectez-vous à iCloud dans les Réglages de l'iPhone pour synchroniser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed out of iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déconnecté d'iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slide it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faites-la glisser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start browsing": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commencer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter le téléchargement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swipe a tab left to close it. Hold it to pin it, bookmark it, or move it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glissez un onglet vers la gauche pour le fermer. Maintenez-le pour l'épingler, l'ajouter aux signets ou le déplacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aller à l'onglet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync was turned off: Search's data was deleted from iCloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisation désactivée : les données de Search ont été supprimées d'iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sync with iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchroniser avec iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Table": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tableau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onglets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs you haven't looked at for that long close by themselves; pinned tabs never do. Locked private tabs ask for Face ID when you come back to Search.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les onglets non consultés depuis ce délai se ferment d'eux-mêmes ; jamais les épinglés. Les onglets privés verrouillés demandent Face ID à votre retour dans Search."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap it to search or type an address. Hold it for the page's menu: back, share, find, text size, pin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez-la pour rechercher ou saisir une adresse. Maintenez-la pour le menu de la page : retour, partage, recherche, taille du texte, épingle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap what to hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez ce qu'il faut masquer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text size": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taille du texte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download didn't finish": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le téléchargement n'a pas abouti"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last hour": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dernière heure"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page keeps that on screen. Try Wider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La page garde cet élément à l’écran. Essayez Plus large."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page you're on shows up on your Mac, and your Mac's page here, through Apple's Handoff: your own devices, nearby, on the same Apple Account. Private tabs never. Handoff itself keeps nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La page ouverte apparaît sur votre Mac, et celle du Mac ici, grâce à Handoff d'Apple : vos propres appareils, à proximité, sur le même compte Apple. Jamais les onglets privés. Handoff ne conserve rien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pins and the tabs beside the page, as on the Mac, while the screen is wide enough.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les épingles et les onglets à côté de la page, comme sur le Mac, quand l’écran est assez large."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site isn't answering.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le site ne répond pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site took too long to answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le site a mis trop de temps à répondre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site's secure connection can't be trusted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La connexion sécurisée du site n'est pas fiable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sites you visit most, under your bookmarks on a new tab. Turning this off hides them; your history stays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les sites que vous visitez le plus, sous vos signets dans un nouvel onglet. Les masquer ne touche pas à votre historique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Third-party ad networks and trackers are stopped before they load. If a site breaks, hold the address and allow ads on that site alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les régies publicitaires et les traqueurs tiers sont bloqués avant de se charger. Si un site ne marche plus, autorisez les publicités sur ce site seul dans « Ce site »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce site"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site can't be found. Check the address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce site est introuvable. Vérifiez l'adresse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aujourd'hui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today and yesterday": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aujourd'hui et hier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch a line to see it on the page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez une ligne pour la voir sur la page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déverrouiller"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock your private tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déverrouiller vos onglets privés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpin": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désépingler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Video": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vidéo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website data cleared": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Données des sites effacées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you type is sent to %@ as you type, so it can suggest searches. Never from private tabs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous tapez est envoyé à %@ pendant la saisie, pour suggérer des recherches. Jamais depuis les onglets privés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wider": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus large"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With your Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec votre Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words typed in the field go to this search when they aren't an address. Nothing you type is sent anywhere until you press Go.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que vous tapez part vers ce moteur quand ce n'est pas une adresse. Rien n'est envoyé avant que vous appuyiez sur OK."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous êtes hors ligne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iCloud is full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre iCloud est plein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your open tabs, pins and bookmarks follow you between Search on your iPhone and on your Mac, through your own iCloud. Turn on Sync with iCloud on the Mac too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos onglets ouverts, épingles et signets vous suivent entre Search sur votre iPhone et sur votre Mac, par votre propre iCloud. Activez aussi Synchroniser avec iCloud sur le Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your open tabs, pins, bookmarks, search engine and appearance, the same on your iPhone and your Mac, through your own iCloud. Encrypted end to end: nobody else, us included, can read it. Private tabs never.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos onglets ouverts, épingles, favoris, moteur de recherche et apparence, identiques sur votre iPhone et votre Mac, via votre propre iCloud. Chiffré de bout en bout : personne d'autre, nous compris, ne peut le lire. Jamais les onglets privés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos onglets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tabs, pins, bookmarks and settings leave iCloud, for every device. What is on each device stays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos onglets, épingles, favoris et réglages quittent iCloud, pour tous les appareils. Ce qui est sur chaque appareil reste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "bottom": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "en bas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "go": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "https://example.com/search?q=%s": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "iOS asks before any site gets your location, and you can turn it off for Search altogether in the iPhone's Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS demande avant qu'un site obtienne votre position, et vous pouvez la couper pour Search dans les Réglages de l'iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "middle": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "au milieu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
